<title>HONG KONG: China Vanke posts lower interim net.</title>
<headline>China Vanke posts lower interim net.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		0.19	 vs 0.23</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     15.06 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			 59.75	vs 63.05</p>
<p>    Turnover		  487.64     vs 677.53</p>
<p>    Company name	    China Vanke Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - China Vanke engages in property development and equity investments in China. Results were prepared in conformity with international accounting standards. Profit is after tax and minority interests.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
